*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Generated converter output. The layout rule (`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` §1.1) states that `examples/` holds the
# sample input and the example text files only: the canonical sample output is the golden set, so no run
# output is committed here.
test_output/
output_*/
split_configs/
*-tf/
terraform_output/
terraform_example/

# Cached API responses: fetched customer data, and the CI cache the tests build
panorama_cache/

